{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309390","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130939001:1":{"text":"그거야 초코보로 연락했죠! 초코보는 빠르고 똑똑해서 근처의 부족들은 다들 몇 마리씩 키우고 있거든요.","source_cn":"当然是靠陆行鸟了！它们跑得快，又聪明，附近的部落都养了一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27490C4B1ADBFE81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130939002:1":{"text":"얼마 전에 초코보가 뜬금없이 사람을 공격하던 일만 없었다면, 부족에서도 저랑 오라큘라를 세일린워터 마을로 보내지 않았을 거예요.","source_cn":"要不是之前它们莫名其妙攻击大家，不听命令，部落也不会派...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59F9A16DBE8EF946","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130939003:1":{"text":"그래도 이제 괜찮아져서 다행이에요. 초코보도 다시 얌전해졌고요!","source_cn":"还好现在没事了，陆行鸟又变得听话了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E4D052C43F12DBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130939004:1":{"text":"이제 와 생각하니 저희는 초코보 없이는 안 될 것 같아요.","source_cn":"这么一想，我们还真是离不开它呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2B8F36541A7B288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血塔比提":{"text":"타비티","source":"蛮血塔比提","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}